LIQUID GLASS CARD: dark = white gradient overlay + rgb(14 16 20 / .62), backdrop-filter
blur(22px) saturate(170%), 1px token border, bright inset top rim, sheen via ::before, deep soft
shadow. Light = ivory gradient rgb(255 252 244 / .94) to rgb(251 246 234 / .72) with warm shadow
