Theme: follow the OS until the user chooses; persist the choice; set the theme-color meta (#0A0B0D
dark, #F4ECDD light) and color-scheme on <html>.
CSS ARCHITECTURE: component classes live in `@layer components` so Tailwind utilities can override
them. Every class used by a component must exist (no references to undefined classes such as
liquid-glass-dock). Do not leave a second stylesheet that redefines the same tokens.

=====================================================================
4. MARKETS SCREEN DATA RULES
=====================================================================
- Hero: index level in POINTS (no currency sign, no "$" tooltip on the chart), signed change with a
  real minus sign ("-0.18%", never "+-0.18%"), chips to switch index.
- Sentiment = percent of tracked stocks that are up today (>60 Bullish, <40 Bearish, else Neutral).
- AI Analyst text is generated only from live numbers (breadth, biggest mover, sector averages).
  Never invent claims, probabilities, prices or news.
- Indicators (RSI, MACD, Moving Avg, Bollinger) are computed from the price series. Show "Needs
  more data" when too short: RSI needs 15+ points, MACD 26+, average and bands 10+. Never show a
  misleading value such as "RSI 100 Overbought" from a short series.
- Trend projection = straight-line extension of the recent trend, labelled "Not a forecast or
  advice".
- News thumbnails only when the data has an image field.

=====================================================================
5. BEHAVIOUR, ACCESSIBILITY, PERFORMANCE
=====================================================================
- URL-hash routing (#/explorer/AAPL): Back/Forward and shared links work. After a screen change
  reset scroll and move focus to <main>. Skip-to-content link that does not break the router.
- Touch targets 44px on touch screens (32px with a mouse). Visible focus rings. aria-labels on every
  icon-only button. Respect prefers-reduced-motion. No auto-moving content.
- Toasts: polite live region, one timer per toast id (an old timer must never dismiss a new toast),
  pause on hover/focus, Escape closes, severity shown by icon + text, not colour alone.
- Poll live quotes every 15s but pause while the tab is hidden. Alert checks must read the latest
  user state through a ref (no stale closure over currentUser). Reuse one AudioContext for chimes.
- Handle localStorage failures with try/catch.

